# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Coverage / test artifacts
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/

# Build output — package_skill writes these
*.zip
*.skill
*.partial

# Eval workspaces. These belong beside the skill, not inside it, but they get
# created here often enough to be worth ignoring: they can be large, they carry
# a person's own prompts and outputs, and they are never part of a distribution.
#
# Anchored to the repository root with a leading slash, and tests/ is exempted
# below. An unanchored `*-workspace/` matches at EVERY depth, which silently
# excluded six committed fixture directories under tests/fixtures/ and produced
# a repository whose own test suite failed on a clean clone. The bug was
# invisible locally because the files were already on disk.
/*-workspace/
/evals/

# Never ignore test fixtures. They are inputs to tests that assert byte-level
# behaviour, so a fixture missing from a clone is a test measuring nothing.
!tests/fixtures/**

# Secrets. Belt and braces — package_skill excludes these from archives, but
# nothing should stop them reaching a commit either.
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
